\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 An exploratory analysis of electricity consumption across three zones in Morocco, recorded every 10 minutes during 2017, alongside temperature, humidity and wind speed. The project covers data inspection and cleaning, consumption patterns by hour, day and month, a comparison of the three zones, and an investigation of how environmental variables relate to consumption.\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \
