\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Consumption unit.
\f1\b0  Data dictionary describes consumption as kilowatt-hours, but the magnitudes are more consistent with a power-level reading than with energy per interval. \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Diffuse flow columns
\f1\b0 . GeneralDiffuseFlows and DiffuseFlows are described as emissions gases, but their hourly pattern resembles solar radiation.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	11	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Windspseed
